The algorithm
-------------

The actual discovery scope is natural G2(11), the existing two labelled end
sections, the unchanged bounded C2*V4 word dictionary and exactly the existing
prime37/cofactor6 criterion. The literal ac455 kernel and69566 helpers remain
separately identified and unchanged. A new small module caches required V4
word prefixes and rejects a word unless its trace pair belongs to the eighteen
possible order37/order111 spectra. Every passing word is sent to the literal
old prime_word_fact, which reconstructs the word, verifies its sixth and
thirty-seventh powers, solves its fixed line and checks actual movement.
The cached full matrix must agree with the independently rebuilt literal word.
A trace match alone never emits a scientific certificate.

The mathematical input is spectral_order_certificates.tex and its explicit
review, already read by Root. The ordinary natural7D G2 characteristic identity
makes the first two coefficients sufficient for the spectrum. The reduction
from order(w6)=37 to order(w) in{37,111} additionally imports the retained
involution multiplicity theorem, Cayley contraction and actual natural-model
identification. The existing moved-line generation and maximal-overgroup
classification are unchanged imported inputs. No arbitrary GL7/SO7 trace match
is sufficient. No characteristic-two moved-line claim is made.

Table construction is deferred to genuine Root execution. primitive_table
uses integer arithmetic only for PRIME base fields2..31, never integer mod4
as a substitute forF4. It enumerates all coefficient pairs(t,e2), constructs
the universal characteristic polynomial, divides byX-1, and tests the monic
degree6 factorf. Require f|X^n-1 and gcd(f,X^(n/r)-1)=1 for EVERY prime divisor
r ofn. The input also has n|p2-p+1, n coprime top and ord_n(p)=6. Thus every
root has primitive ordern; degree6 makes one whole Frobenius factor. The
routine enumerates primitive factor signatures generally, not all matrices
of an arbitrary composite order. Only the separately proved37/111 case is
used for Original discovery. The general prime-order theorem extends to prime
power fields, but this code implements prime-field arithmetic only.

At Root runtime this yields six37 and twelve111 rows. The code contains no
computed values for these pairs. The control program checks all six factors
multiply toPhi37, then all eighteen multiply toPhi37(X3). These independent
whole polynomial products close the claimed table completeness. Tables are
created once in the synthetic control execution and reused across jobs.

Every actual producer must join the SAME exact spectral_tables descriptor
through its plan, the genuine new Root control report, its Root code/math
review and gate. validate_tables is STRUCTURAL: it checks strict canonical
coefficients, complete advertised factor coefficients, ordering, cardinality
and pair uniqueness. It does not reconstruct primitive factors in a data run.
Structural validity alone never supplies authority for an arbitrary table.
The binder repeats the exact active control/report/gate/source-peer joins.

