Nine NEW control groups
-----------------------

The old metadata interface requires controls==9. Here the unit is explicitly
NAMED_NEW_GROUP, with every group name and individual assertion count in the
new result. These are nine genuine fresh control groups for the new subject,
not the nine historical GL arithmetic tests under a different name:

1. Small independently expected polynomial arithmetic and zero-divisor refusal.
2. All six primitive37 factors and their completePhi37 product.
3. All twelve primitive111 factors; combined eighteen-factorPhi37(X3) product.
4. Prime-field3/5 cases and refusal of composite field4, boolean field and
   wrong Frobenius degree.
5. Division-free42-product coefficients, odd28-product trace signatures,
   characteristic2 toy coefficient and boolean-matrix refusal.
6. Every raw120 word in both labelled sections, compared with an independent
   literal matrix oracle on noncommuting tiny GL7 permutation fixtures;
   laziness, right-row orientation and invalid syllable/length refusals.
